From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:19:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: apple,jpeg: add the T8132 engines

The M4 (T8132) has two JPEG engines like the M4 Pro/Max. The J604
runtime ADT lists them as jpeg0/jpeg1 ("jpeg,t8101") with hw-type
100008, which is the T6041 revision (0x101008) under the driver's
stepping mask 0xffff0fff, one 0x4000 register window, one interrupt
and one DART each (dart-jpeg0/1, "dart,t8110", sid 0, vm-base
0x10000000000, vm-size 0x30000000000), and both under the JPG power
state, as on T6041.

Describe them as "apple,t8132-jpeg" with "apple,t6041-jpeg" as the
fallback, so the existing T6041 match data and its DMA window rule
apply. The DMA window condition now uses "contains" so that it also
covers the fallback form.

The driver still reads the engine's HWREV at probe and refuses any
revision it does not know, so a T8132 engine that differs only shows
up as "unsupported HWREV" and no video device.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml   | 17 +++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml
index 056e1d33c0..e32cd3c1d3 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml
@@ -19,11 +19,19 @@ description: |
   the engine's 32-bit buffer pointer registers. T8140 engines take 64-bit
   buffer addresses and use their DART's full window.
 
+  The T8132 (M4) engines report the T6041 hardware revision in the ADT (the
+  same under the stepping mask) and use the T6041 programming and DMA
+  window, so they carry the T6041 compatible as a fallback.
+
 properties:
   compatible:
-    enum:
-      - apple,t6041-jpeg
-      - apple,t8140-jpeg
+    oneOf:
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,t8132-jpeg
+          - const: apple,t6041-jpeg
+      - enum:
+          - apple,t6041-jpeg
+          - apple,t8140-jpeg
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
@@ -65,7 +73,8 @@ allOf:
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
-          const: apple,t6041-jpeg
+          contains:
+            const: apple,t6041-jpeg
     then:
       required:
         - apple,dma-range
